messages.content:
{
  "message": "Thanks for the details. Your phone reports the SIM is Missing, there’s no signal, and mobile data is OFF. MMS can’t work until the SIM is detected and the phone registers on the network. Let’s fix the SIM state first, then verify data and MMS.",
  "thought_process": "A missing SIM prevents any cellular registration. Reseating the SIM and rebooting typically restores detection. After the SIM is recognized, we’ll enable mobile data and disable Wi‑Fi Calling (sometimes interferes with MMS) before testing. If needed, we’ll reset APN/MMSC.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Quick Airplane Mode check",
      "why": "Airplane Mode would also show no signal.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_status_bar.",
        "If you see ✈️ Airplane Mode, run toggle_airplane_mode to turn it OFF, then run check_status_bar again to confirm it’s gone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check and reseat the SIM",
      "why": "Your phone reported SIM Missing; reseating usually resolves detection issues.",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_sim_status and tell me what it says.",
        "If it says Missing, run reseat_sim_card.",
        "Then run reboot_device to fully refresh network services."
      ],
      "note": "After reboot, give it up to 1–2 minutes to register on the network."
    },
    {
      "title": "Verify network and enable mobile data",
      "why": "We need an active cellular connection and data for MMS.",
      "actions": [
        "With Wi‑Fi still OFF, run check_network_status.",
        "If Mobile Data shows Disabled, run toggle_data to turn it ON.",
        "Run check_network_status again and confirm you see signal bars and a network type (4G/5G/LTE)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check Wi‑Fi Calling",
      "why": "Wi‑Fi Calling can interfere with MMS on some devices/carriers.",
      "how_to_check": "Run check_wifi_calling_status to see if it’s ON or OFF.",
      "if_on": "If ON, run toggle_wifi_calling to turn it OFF temporarily."
    },
    {
      "title": "Test data and MMS",
      "actions": [
        "Run run_speed_test (with Wi‑Fi OFF) and tell me the result.",
        "Try loading a web page over mobile data.",
        "Try sending an MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "If SIM shows Locked instead of Missing",
      "why": "Locked SIM (PIN/PUK) requires security assistance.",
      "actions": [
        "Stop here and tell me. I will transfer you to a human agent to help with SIM PIN/PUK."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "If MMS still fails but data works",
      "actions": [
        "Run check_network_mode_preference. If you see 2G/3G, run set_network_mode_preference with \"4g_5g_preferred\" and try MMS again.",
