      ]
    }
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What does check_sim_status show right now (after step 2)?",
    "After the reboot, what does check_network_status show (signal bars, network type, Mobile Data ON)?",
    "Is Wi‑Fi Calling ON or OFF according to check_wifi_calling_status?",
    "What was the run_speed_test result, and did the MMS send?"
  ],
  "tip": "Keep Wi‑Fi OFF during these tests so we’re validating mobile data specifically."
}

