      "confirm": "The airplane icon disappears from the status bar and you see signal bars with 4G/LTE/5G (or at least 3G)."
    },
    {
      "step": "Ensure Mobile Data is ON",
      "instructions": [
        "With Wi‑Fi OFF, go to Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > Mobile network > Mobile data and make sure it’s ON."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Test mobile data",
      "instructions": [
        "Open a browser and load example.com or any site.",
        "If it doesn’t load immediately, wait 10–15 seconds for the network to reattach, then try again."
