      "step": "Test MMS",
      "instructions": [
        "Open your messaging app and send a photo to yourself or a contact.",
        "Note if it sends successfully."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "if_still_failing_next": [
    "Reset APN to default, then fully reboot (Settings > Network & Internet > Mobile network > Access Point Names > Reset to default, then power off/on).",
    "Temporarily turn OFF Wi‑Fi Calling and retry MMS.",
    "Verify messaging app permissions: ensure Storage/Photos and SMS are Allowed."
  ],
  "what_to_reply_with": [
    "1) After changing the Preferred network type, what network icon do you see now (3G/4G/LTE/5G) and how many bars roughly?",
    "2) Could you load a webpage over mobile data?",
    "3) Did the MMS send successfully, or what happened?"
  ]
}

